  },
  "description_short": "Martin Marietta, a member of the S&P 500 Index, is an American-based company and a leading supplier of aggregates, lime and limestone products, magnesia-based products and other building materials. Supported by industry-leading reserves and a network of operations spanning 29 states, Canada and The Bahamas, Martin Marietta supplies the essential materials that help build, connect and sustain communities across North America.",
